    "chunk_text": "PART III - LANDS\n\nTitle Registration\n\nREGISTRATION OF TITLE ACT, No. 21 OF 1998\n\nDeclaration of Determination of the Commissioner of Title Settlement under Section 14\n\nBY virtue of the powers vested in me under Section 14 of the Registration of Title Act, No.21 of 1998, I, the undersigned, hereby declare my determination as set out in the Schedule appended hereto in regard to the title to parcel of Land Nos. 1 : 11, 1 : 43, 1 : 58 and 1 : 69 of Block 3, contained in the Cadastral Map No. 620445, situated in the Village of Niyangama within the Grama Niladhari Division of No. 236 - Niyangama in the Divisional Secretary's Division of Godakawela, in the District of Ratnapura, in the Province of Sabaragamuwa, referred to in Notice No. 62/0722 calling for claims to land parcels which was duly published in the Gazette No. 2357/07 of 06th August, 2024 in terms of Section 12 of the Registration of Title Act, No.21 of 1998. P. C. D. Sigera, Commissioner General of Land Title Settlement. Land Title Settlement Department, No. 1200/6, \u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla, 22th July, 2025.\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\n\u0dc1\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dca\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dba\u0dda \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dc1\u0dd9\u0dc2 EXTRAORDINARY The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2449/47 - 2025 \u0d85\u0dc1 \u0ddd\u0dc3\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd4 \u0db8\u0dc3 15 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0dc3\u0dd2\u0d9a\u0dd4\u0dbb\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2025.08.15\n\nNo. 2449/47 \u2013 FRIDAY, AUGUST 15, 2025\n\nN.B.\u2013 This Extraordinary Gazette can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A - G 045131 - 04 (2025/08)\n\n2 A\n\nIII \u0dba\u0